o a sus dos hijos." type="episode" contentRating="M/16" duration="3600000" grandparentArt="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vmuf-thum-wide.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6882d23f2bdc7b90d86a0f71" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6882d23f2bdc7b90d86a0f71" grandparentRatingKey="6882d23f2bdc7b90d86a0f71" grandparentThumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/show/thumbnails/widescreen/2000x2858/vmuf-thum-wide_0.jpg" grandparentTitle="Mundo de Fieras" grandparentType="show" index="105" originallyAvailableAt="2026-05-11T00:00:00Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vmuf-thum-wide.jpg" title="Episodio 233" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episodio 233" type="coverArt" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vmuf-thum-wide.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 233" type="coverPoster" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/show/thumbnails/widescreen/2000x2858/vmuf-thum-wide_0.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 233" type="snapshot" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vmuf-thum-wide.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" id="6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" ratingKey="genre_6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" slug="en-espanol" tag="En Español" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1782554400" duration="3600000" endsAt="1782558000" id="6a35e0afc65117b1794c00f9" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video><Video guid="plex://episode/6a31ebecb0a3bef5040e16a7" key="/library/metadata/6a31ebecb0a3bef5040e16a7" ratingKey="6a31ebecb0a3bef5040e16a7" summary="Wilker y Briggite están sumamente cerca como para besarse pero Briggite piensa mejor las cosas y comienza a gritar como que le duele el brazo y le dice a Wilker que termine de montar las persianas. Solymar le requiere a Yubirí más información porque cree que le está ocultando algo. Yubirí le dice que es todo y que va a llamar a Briggite para ver como está. Solymar la llama jala mecate y le dice que se ubique. Wilker coloca la persiana totalmente torcida. Briggite le reclama y él la arregla.." type="episode" contentRating="M/16" duration="3600000" grandparentArt="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/cgue-thum-wide.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6a1e25448907dc3c7000c157" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6a1e25448907dc3c7000c157" grandparentRatingKey="6a1e25448907dc3c7000c157" grandparentThumb="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/f0264004-d833-4809-8173-dc12f75e70e0/Novelisima_vert_2000x3000_-_Ali_Clausen.jpg" grandparentTitle="Guerra de Mujeres" grandparentType="show" index="10" originallyAvailableAt="2026-05-11T00:00:00Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/cgue-thum-wide.jpg" title="Episodio 12" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episodio 12" type="coverArt" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/cgue-thum-wide.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 12" type="coverPoster" url="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/f0264004-d833-4809-8173-dc12f75e70e0/Novelisima_vert_2000x3000_-_Ali_Clausen.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 12" type="snapshot" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/cgue-thum-wide.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" id="6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" ratingKey="genre_6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" slug="en-espanol" tag="En Español" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1782576000" duration="3600000" endsAt="1782579600" id="6a35e0afc65117b1794c00ff" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video><Video gui